# String Calculator (TDD Kata) - JavaScript

This repository contains a String Calculator implemented using a TDD workflow.
It supports:

- Empty string => 0
- Comma String
- newline as delimiters
- Custom delimiter syntax: `//<delimiter>\n<numbers...>` (supports multi-character delimiters)
- Throws an error for negative numbers and lists all negatives in the message

## How to run assignment

- Clone the repository https://github.com/romin1299/Assignment-Of-Incubyte.git
- Install dependencies - npm install

## How to run test suits

- Go inside the TDD-Test-Suits folder
- run the command in command prompt - npm test